      "review": "I have.. mixed feelings about this movie. First, the good: the acting is quite good for most of the runtime from both Jennifer Lawrence and Chris Pratt. Also, the premise is a really really good idea that ties in heavy themes of consent, romance, and betrayal. However, everything seems to be cast off for a typical action-packed ending sequence in the last thirty minutes, leaving me dissapointed. This movie had potential to be great, it really did, but it falls flat in too many areas for me to give it a high rating."
