      "review": "Believe it or not, this is my first time watching this movie… I’m planning on watching all three extended cut editions with my dad while we build the Eye of Sauron LEGO set. I don’t think the timings are going to match up, though, we’ve finished more than half of the set and we only finished one movie. It’s a whopping 3 hours 50 minutes long… but I wasn’t bored or tired of it for a second. I’ve read the books, and the extra length the movie has really allows it to flesh out the world and characters that Tolkien masterfully created. It’s amazing that the visuals of this movie still hold up…"
